Derived work: ../../src/vkb_nrd.cpp is adapted from nrd_wrapper.cpp / nrd_wrapper.hpp. Changes (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
  - removed the nvpro_core2 / nvvk dependency (raw Vulkan helpers instead);
  - VK_KHR_push_descriptor replaced by descriptor-set pools (one pool per frame slot);
  - the empty image-barrier list of denoise()/dispatch() replaced by a global memory barrier between dispatches;
  - assert() replaced by explicit error returns; flat C API (include/vkb_nrd.h) added;
  - NRD is loaded at runtime from a user-supplied NRD.dll (no static linking, nothing from NRD is embedded);
  - added SIGMA_SHADOW support and a dynamic-offset constant buffer.

